# Everything under .zolletta-metaskill/ is machine-local — caches, run folders,
# the ADR distiller cache, plans. settings.json is the exception: it carries the
# thresholds and scan roots every sensor reads, so it is version-controlled or a
# fresh clone silently runs the sensors on different numbers. The directory's
# *contents* are ignored rather than the directory itself, because git does not
# descend into an excluded directory and a negation inside one would not apply.
.zolletta-metaskill/*
!.zolletta-metaskill/settings.json
coverage.xml
.coverage
